# Valley Floodcaller: "You may cast noncreature spells as though they had flash" (CR 307.5, 702.8). In Bot2's turn 2 Bot1
# casts Life, the sorcery half of Life // Death (CR 709.3: the half alone is the spell), and its Island becomes a 1/1
# creature until end of turn. The permission is its controller's alone: in Bot1's turn 3 Bot2, holding a Life // Death of
# its own and an untapped Forest, may not cast Life, and in its own main phase in turn 4 it does - the positive control at
# sorcery timing.

